    "body": "The EU General Data Protection Regulation will be in full force from 25th of May 2018 - lets make it super clear to users, if any part of their ASB config is violating GDPR.\r\n\r\nI'm pretty sure about 90% of all ASB options are GDPR compliant (except external spam DBs and maybe the Google Language API) so this is issue is more about some interface tweaks to guide users rather than actually changing GDPR compliance, but #154 might benefit this.",
